  The v0.7.10 release adds explicit Quantize/Dequantize operations supporting:
  - Q() / DQ() functions for ONNX-style graph patterns
  - fake_quantize() for quantization-aware training (QAT)
  - qdq_linear(), qdq_matmul(), qdq_conv2d() - high-level ops with Q/DQ
  - create_qdq_params() for calibration-based parameter creation
  - quantize_error() for SNR analysis
  - Per-channel and per-tensor modes
  - Symmetric and asymmetric quantization

  Ready for v0.7.11 (Calibration) when you want to continue.


