  2. DRAM EVENT HIERARCHY
  ================================================================================

                             DRAM_TOTAL
                                 │
              ┌──────────────────┼──────────────────┐
              │                  │                  │
          DRAM_TXN          DRAM_MAINT         DRAM_CTRL
              │                  │                  │
       ┌──────┴──────┐           │           ┌─────┴─────┐
       │             │           │           │           │
   DRAM_READ    DRAM_WRITE   DRAM_REFRESH  DRAM_ACT   DRAM_PRE
       │             │
       │             │
  (bytes,latency) (bytes,latency)


  DRAM EVENTS TABLE:
  ┌─────────────────────┬────────┬────────────┬────────────────────────────────┐
  │ Event               │ Level  │ Aggregates │ Metrics                        │
  ├─────────────────────┼────────┼────────────┼────────────────────────────────┤
  │ DRAM_READ           │ L0     │ -          │ count, bytes, cycles           │
  │ DRAM_WRITE          │ L0     │ -          │ count, bytes, cycles           │
  │ DRAM_ACTIVATE       │ L0     │ -          │ count, cycles (tRCD latency)   │
  │ DRAM_PRECHARGE      │ L0     │ -          │ count, cycles (tRP latency)    │
  │ DRAM_REFRESH        │ L0     │ -          │ count, cycles (tRFC latency)   │
  │ DRAM_TXN            │ L1     │ READ+WRITE │ count, bytes, cycles           │
  │ DRAM_ROW_OPS        │ L1     │ ACT+PRE    │ count, cycles                  │
  │ DRAM_MAINT          │ L1     │ REFRESH    │ count, cycles                  │
  │ DRAM_TOTAL          │ L2     │ TXN+ROW+   │ count, bytes, cycles           │
  │                     │        │ MAINT      │                                │
  └─────────────────────┴────────┴────────────┴────────────────────────────────┘

  DRAM DERIVED METRICS:
    page_hit_count  = DRAM_TXN.count - DRAM_ACT.count
    page_miss_count = DRAM_ACT.count
    page_hit_rate   = page_hit_count / DRAM_TXN.count

  DRAM XUE METRICS:
    X_dram = DRAM_TXN.bytes / total_cycles                    [bytes/cycle]
    U_dram = (read_cycles + write_cycles) / total_cycles      [0.0 - 1.0]
    E_dram = X_dram / peak_bandwidth                          [0.0 - 1.0]

