  Key Design Principles

  - Hierarchical Event Recording: Named operations (OP_MATMUL) record total FLOPs; ALU primitives (ALU_MAC) record counts only
  - Occupancy Integration: Per-cycle accumulation via tick() for accurate delay estimation via Little's Law
  - No Double Counting: FLOPs tracked at exactly one level in the hierarchy

