● All 75 tests pass.

  Summary: RCA and Fix

  Root Cause

  The XUE characterization WAS showing, but with misleading labels:

  1. matmul_events was counting ALL NAMED_OP events (matmul + relu + etc.), not just matmul
  2. elementwise_events was counting ALL ALU_PRIMITIVE ops (including MACs from matmul), not just elementwise ops
  3. memory_events was 0 because BehavioralComputeFabric didn't record DRAM traffic

  Fixes Applied

  1. include/sw/xue/operational_analysis.hpp - Fixed event counting to use specific event types:
    - matmul_events = OP_MATMUL + OP_GEMM + OP_CONV2D
    - elementwise_events = OP_RELU + OP_GELU + OP_SIGMOID + OP_TANH + OP_BIAS_ADD + OP_LAYERNORM + OP_BATCHNORM
  2. src/models/behavioral/compute/compute_fabric.cpp - Added memory event recording:
    - submit_matmul(): Records DRAM read for A, B matrices and DRAM write for C
    - submit_elementwise(): Records DRAM read for input(s) and DRAM write for output

